        "question_type": "Objective",
        "exam_year": "2000",
        "question_text": "<p>The volume of a given mass of gas is 200 cm<sup>3</sup> at 27\u00b0C. What will be its volume at 127\u00b0C if the pressure remains constant?</p>",
